{
  "$schema": "../schema/token.schema.json",
  "description": "2one colour tokens. Grayscale-founded with a single brand accent (#30A1FF, token --brand) for emphasis only. danger/success are validation + data-trend hues (paired with a direction cue). TWO THEMES: `semantic` is the light set, `semantic_dark` the dark one; always say which theme a value belongs to. Contrast pairs cover both and carry a `theme` field.",
